<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs $0.50 higher - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 higher. Demand moderate to good on a moderate movement.</p>
<p>Top $57.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>				 Country				Plant</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 LBS.  55.00-56.00 Few 54.50 &amp; 56.50  55.50-57.00 US 2-3  230-260 LBS.  50.00-54.00</p>
<p>	  210-230 LBS.  45.00-50.00</p>
<p>Sows:  Steady to Weak. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-500 LBS.  41.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 LBS.  45.00-47.50</p>
<p>Few over 600 LBS.  47.50-48.50</p>
